# Every address this screen painted IN THE STATES ITS SWEEP DRIVES,
# folded by `repeating_site`.
#
# R2159 — that qualifier is not pedantry and it replaces a claim this
# header made for six rounds: "every address this screen paints".
# The set is the union over the sweep's own STATES x SIZES, so a mark
# the sweep never reaches is absent from a file that said it held
# everything. A family's ABSENCE here therefore means one of two
# things and the file cannot tell you which: the screen does not paint
# it, or the sweep does not go where it is painted. That matters
# because the address campaign's rule is PIN BEFORE CONVERTING, and a
# reader taking absence for the first reading would convert a family
# whose value nothing holds.
#
# Rewritten by setting PINION_REGEN_ADDRESS_PIN and running this
# screen's address-pin test; do not hand-edit.
